# Mutation plan for websocket reconnect replay — D-181 (2026-09-15).
#
#   scripts/mutate-batch.sh scripts/mutations/websocket-reconnect.plan
#
# The decisions a reader could get wrong: the dead queue's off-by-one and wrap direction, the
# reuse gate on hello, which connection a resume may take, what parking keeps, the message-loss
# arm's new id and restarted counter, and the offline an unregister owes. Not planned: a missing
# sequence number is refused by the parse either way (equivalent), and the activity update is
# read only by a five-minute reaper and a five-minute away test. The last two lines are no-op
# controls and must SURVIVE.
